 and MK were supported by the Swedish Foundation for Strategic Research (Senior Individual Grant). MK was also supported by the Knut and Alice Wallenberg Foundation through the Swegene consortium and the Strategic Science Foundation (Lund Strategic Center for Clinical Cancer Research).</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>